  "witness_assessment": [
    "The existing driver retains owned exclusive evidence output, checked close and protected setup. The new modes add no Core memory mutation, constructor, geometry solver or shipping callback. Real request/reply delegation is unchanged outside the armed operation and selected alterations.",
    "The new request recognizer checks scene 0, absent depth/kind/definition, sixteen complete raw-word patterns and phase encoding. The real-answer recognizer checks the five-state grammar, cursor only for FIRST and no nonempty name. It is a diagnostic wire/shape observer, not an independent arithmetic or full semantic oracle; the production boundary remains responsible for finite/map/phase legality.",
    "SCAN alterations are formed after a parsed request and schema-valid real reply. The state defect is applied only at BEGIN, cursor corruption only to real FIRST, and refusal alterations occur once. Exact anchored Engine markers, positive alteration counts and global VIEW application are required; an incidental callback/setup error is not credited as the intended cursor/state refusal.",
    "The paired controls hold the same declared configured narrowphase hit in both worlds. scan_none changes only eligible BEGIN answers to valid DONE_NONE; its verdict requires every armed SCAN question altered, zero downstream Candidate/narrowphase questions, zero entity hits and a completed finite cohort. scan_real requires positive offer/test/narrowphase/caller use. Pair physical effects are compared to each other; the natural control is separate.",
    "SCAN phase/state counters classify the REAL delegated replies. In scan_none, real FIRST=114 and real DONE_NONE=0 are consistent with 114 delivered empty answers, recorded separately by scan_answered_done_none. They must not be published as 114 real DONE_NONE answers.",
    "Provider/caller counts and VIEW_WEAPON are global while armed. The single selected cohort is tracked separately with actual selection/launch/birth/terminal joins; neither provider questions nor physical effects are claimed to belong uniquely to that weapon. Natural refers to unchanged model answers, not an unconfigured camera/world.",
    "The Original control has the actual fixture API and positive real caller lookups with no SCAN, Candidate or narrowphase provider questions. Its expected nonzero diagnostic exit is a reached handoff-capability RED, not absence of an API or proof that Original narrowphase ran."
  ],
